						<r3d:remarks>AgroPortal is based on OntoPortal generic technology (https://ontoportal.org/) and implements the MOD metadata standard (https://github.com/FAIR-IMPACT/MOD).
Currently, AgroPortal is an open project maintained MISTEA research unit at INRAE. The project was initially launched at LIRMM (CNRS &amp; University of Montpellier) in 2016 and in collaboration with Stanford University. Since 2020, this partnership has initiated the OntoPortal Alliance (https://ontoportal.org) which now brings these themes and the underlying technology into a multidisciplinary context.</r3d:remarks>
